counter bizarre characters, solve cryptic puzzles, and survive the horrors that lurk in every shadow. Will you escape this living nightmare, or will it consume you?<br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525970/extras/c9929daa29e77e4c4ff391ed46321819.poster.avif?t=1772822760\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525970/extras/c9929daa29e77e4c4ff391ed46321819.webm?t=1772822760\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incrementally gain and collect materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat horrific foes over 1000 floors in the dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and explore the depths of your camp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear to venture deeper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet God</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become worthy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repeat, adapt, and survive. The depths need you, and you, them.</p>","developers":["Alexandre Declos ","Pas Game Studio"],"dlc":[4326710],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3525970/167f9ae0705e3277dea4dd22365851188db5e1ba/header.jpg?t=1772822760","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux distribution released after 2020<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86_64 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated 